message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "shorter-not-longer"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Alternateacc-1/shorter-not-longer"
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-12"
abstract: >-
  Code and results for the ITI 2026 paper "Shorter, Not Longer? Residual Entropy of BCH
  Fuzzy Commitments over Deep Face Embeddings". Recomputes every number in the paper from
  the deep-funneled LFW images: exact BCH parity, decode failure, false-accept rates,
  effective degrees of freedom, bootstrap closure, and the robustness analyses.
keywords:
  - fuzzy commitment
  - biometric template protection
  - BCH codes
  - face recognition
  - LFW
